  "releaseNotes": "- fix: generated code compiles for views over array-typed and unqualified model types. `fsTypeName` renders array types as `T[]` (was the bogus `[]<T>` from FCS's generic-shaped array metadata); the tool now mirrors the pure source file's `open` directives into the generated file, so unqualified type names (`V3f`, `Trafo3d`) and custom scene-builders (e.g. a `heap { }` CE) resolve. Surfaced by a real heap/CAD view with `V3f[]`/`V4f[]` leaf fields.\n- (internal) array-typed leaf fields use ChangeableValueCustomEquality/ShallowEquals in the `…Mapped` emitter (reference equality, not a structural `cval` compare).",
  "title": "Adaptify.PureView",
